      "npc" : "Fenrir",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Sealed in the underground",
      "translation" : "封印在普隆德拉城堡"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 19,
      "npc" : "Fenrir",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "of the Prontera Castle...",
      "translation" : "地下深處..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 20,
      "npc" : "Fenrir",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "I didn't expect it to be this huge...",
      "translation" : "沒想到這裡竟然這麼大..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 23,
      "npc" : "Fenrir",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Iris]",
      "translation" : "[艾麗絲]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 24,
      "npc" : "Fenrir",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "What on earth is there inside?",
      "translation" : "裡面到底有什麼？"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 27,
      "npc" : "Fenrir",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Fenrir]",
      "translation" : "[芬里爾]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 28,
      "npc" : "Fenrir",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "I don't know. Let's investigate the inside, first.",
      "translation" : "不知道。我們先進去調查一下吧。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 96,
      "npc" : "Iris",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Iris]",
      "translation" : "[艾麗絲]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 97,
      "npc" : "Iris",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "This...this must be...",
      "translation" : "這...這一定是..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 98,
      "npc" : "Iris",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Ymir's Heart!",
      "translation" : "尤彌爾之心！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 101,
      "npc" : "Iris",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Fenrir]",
      "translation" : "[芬里爾]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 102,
      "npc" : "Iris",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "This...",
      "translation" : "這..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 103,
      "npc" : "Iris",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "This is Ymir's Heart...",
      "translation" : "這是尤彌爾之心..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 106,
      "npc" : "Iris",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "~Rumbling~",
      "translation" : "~轟隆隆~"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 110,
      "npc" : "Iris",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Iris]",
      "translation" : "[艾麗絲]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 111,
      "npc" : "Iris",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Why is this place shaking?!",
      "translation" : "這裡為什麼在搖晃？！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 114,
      "npc" : "Iris",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Fenrir]",
      "translation" : "[芬里爾]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 115,
      "npc" : "Iris",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "~Grunts~ They must've started attacking this place, too.",
      "translation" : "~悶哼~看來他們也開始攻擊這裡了。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 119,
      "npc" : "Iris",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Bijou]",
      "translation" : "[碧珠]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 120,
      "npc" : "Iris",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "~Grins~ Delighted to see you all.",
      "translation" : "~咧嘴笑~見到你們真高興。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 123,
      "npc" : "Iris",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Fenrir]",
      "translation" : "[芬里爾]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 124,
      "npc" : "Iris",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "!!",
      "translation" : "！！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 125,
      "npc" : "Iris",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "You've got to be kidding me!",
      "translation" : "開什麼玩笑！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 128,
      "npc" : "Iris",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Bijou]",
      "translation" : "[碧珠]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 129,
      "npc" : "Iris",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "From this moment on, we the Immortal Legion by Lord Valkyrie Himelmez",
      "translation" : "從現在開始，隸屬於女武神希梅爾茲大人的不死軍團"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 130,
      "npc" : "Iris",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "will take over here.",
      "translation" : "將接管這裡。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 134,
      "npc" : "Iris",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Iris]",
      "translation" : "[艾麗絲]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 135,
      "npc" : "Iris",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "What? How dare you!",
      "translation" : "什麼？你竟敢！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 136,
      "npc" : "Iris",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "I'm game. Bring it on!",
      "translation" : "有本事就來吧！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 139,
      "npc" : "Iris",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Bijou]",
      "translation" : "[碧珠]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 140,
      "npc" : "Iris",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "~Grins~ Do I look like I have the time to deal with a petty thing like you, human?",
      "translation" : "~咧嘴笑~人類，你覺得我有時間對付你這種小角色嗎？"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 141,
      "npc" : "Iris",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "But, out of pure mercy, I'll let you taste the fearful power of the Immortal Legion just a little bit.",
      "translation" : "不過，出於慈悲，我就讓你稍微嚐嚐不死軍團的可怕力量。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 144,
      "npc" : "Iris",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Fenrir]",
      "translation" : "[芬里爾]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 145,
      "npc" : "Iris",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "~Grunts~ When did all the legionnaires get here?",
      "translation" : "~悶哼~這些軍團士兵是什麼時候來的？"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 223,
      "npc" : "Iris",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Bijou]",
      "translation" : "[碧珠]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 224,
      "npc" : "Iris",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "~Chuckles~ I think you're not that bad for a human.",
      "translation" : "~輕笑~作為人類，你還算不錯。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 227,
      "npc" : "Iris",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Bijou]",
      "translation" : "[碧珠]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 228,
      "npc" : "Iris",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "But do you think you can get away from this, again? Wake up, my underlings!",
      "translation" : "不過你覺得這次還能逃掉嗎？醒來吧，我的部下！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 235,
      "npc" : "Iris",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Iris]",
      "translation" : "[艾麗絲]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 236,
      "npc" : "Iris",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "What...what's up with this monster?!",
      "translation" : "這...這怪物是怎麼回事？！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 239,
      "npc" : "Iris",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Bijou]",
      "translation" : "[碧珠]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 240,
      "npc" : "Iris",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Ah...",
      "translation" : "啊..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 241,
      "npc" : "Iris",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "I'll let you in on me before I go.",
      "translation" : "在我離開之前，就讓你知道我的身份吧。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 242,
      "npc" : "Iris",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "I'm Bijou.",
      "translation" : "我叫碧珠。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 243,
      "npc" : "Iris",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "I'm the adjutant to Lord Valkyrie Himelmez.",
      "translation" : "我是女武神希梅爾茲大人的副官。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 246,
      "npc" : "Iris",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Fenrir]",
      "translation" : "[芬里爾]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 247,
      "npc" : "Iris",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "~Groans~",
      "translation" : "~呻吟~"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 248,
      "npc" : "Iris",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "No Valkyrie's subordinates ever disappointed me and neither did you.",
      "translation" : "女武神的部下從沒讓我失望過，你也一樣。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 249,
      "npc" : "Iris",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Ymir's Heart is a huge energy source. For what do you want to use it anyway?",
      "translation" : "尤彌爾之心蘊含著巨大的能量。你們到底想用它做什麼？"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 252,
      "npc" : "Iris",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Bijou]",
      "translation" : "[碧珠]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 253,
      "npc" : "Iris",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "......",
      "translation" : "..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 254,
      "npc" : "Iris",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "You don't need to know. You're going to be wiped out soon anyway.",
      "translation" : "你不必知道。反正你們很快就會被消滅。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 257,
      "npc" : "Iris",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Fenrir]",
      "translation" : "[芬里爾]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 258,
      "npc" : "Iris",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "I don't think you'd use it for any good cause.",
      "translation" : "我不認為你們會把它用在正道上。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 259,
      "npc" : "Iris",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "I'll stop Bijou from taking Ymir's Heart. You go ahead and take care of that huge monster!",
      "translation" : "我去阻止碧珠奪走尤彌爾之心。你去對付那隻巨大的魔物！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 423,
      "npc" : "Iris",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Iris]",
      "translation" : "[艾麗絲]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 424,
      "npc" : "Iris",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Was that it...? Has it gone now?",
      "translation" : "結束了嗎...？它已經消失了嗎？"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 425,
      "npc" : "Iris",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "So what's left now is...",
      "translation" : "那麼現在剩下的就是..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 429,
      "npc" : "Iris",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Bijou]",
      "translation" : "[碧珠]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 430,
      "npc" : "Iris",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Me...I'm the only one left...",
      "translation" : "我...只剩我一個了..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 433,
      "npc" : "Iris",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Iris]",
      "translation" : "[艾麗絲]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 434,
      "npc" : "Iris",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "What?!",
      "translation" : "什麼？！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 436,
      "npc" : "Iris",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "~POW!~",
      "translation" : "~砰！~"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 440,
      "npc" : "Iris",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Iris]",
      "translation" : "[艾麗絲]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 441,
      "npc" : "Iris",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Aaarrghhh---!!!",
      "translation" : "啊啊啊---！！！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 444,
      "npc" : "Iris",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Bijou]",
      "translation" : "[碧珠]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 445,
      "npc" : "Iris",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "I must say it was rather unexpected. ~Chuckles~",
      "translation" : "不得不說，這實在出乎我的意料。~輕笑~"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 446,
      "npc" : "Iris",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "I didn't expect anyone to defeat Amdarais that I spent three good years to complete.",
      "translation" : "我沒想到有人能打敗阿姆達萊斯，我可是花了整整三年才完成它。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 449,
      "npc" : "Iris",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Bijou]",
      "translation" : "[碧珠]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 450,
      "npc" : "Iris",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "You will pay",
      "translation" : "你要為此付出代價"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 451,
      "npc" : "Iris",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "for ruining my three-year efforts!!",
      "translation" : "竟敢毀掉我三年的心血！！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 452,
      "npc" : "Iris",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Slowly...",
      "translation" : "慢慢地..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 453,
      "npc" : "Iris",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "And horribly painfully...!!",
      "translation" : "痛苦地死去...!!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 500,
      "npc" : "Fenrir",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Fenrir]",
      "translation" : "[芬里爾]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 501,
      "npc" : "Fenrir",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "~Groans~ I can't believe nothing seems to work!",
      "translation" : "~呻吟~真不敢相信，所有攻擊似乎都沒用！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 504,
      "npc" : "Fenrir",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Bijou]",
      "translation" : "[碧珠]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 505,
      "npc" : "Fenrir",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "~Chuckles~",
      "translation" : "~輕笑~"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 506,
      "npc" : "Fenrir",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "I'll let you taste what despair feels like.",
      "translation" : "我會讓你嚐嚐絕望的滋味。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 509,
      "npc" : "Fenrir",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Bijou]",
      "translation" : "[碧珠]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 510,
      "npc" : "Fenrir",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Frost Diver!",
      "translation" : "冰凍術！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 516,
      "npc" : "Fenrir",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Fenrir]",
      "translation" : "[芬里爾]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 517,
      "npc" : "Fenrir",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "~Groans~",
      "translation" : "~呻吟~"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 520,
      "npc" : "Fenrir",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Bijou]",
      "translation" : "[碧珠]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 521,
      "npc" : "Fenrir",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "How does it feel? Painful, eh?",
      "translation" : "感覺如何？很痛苦吧？"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 522,
      "npc" : "Fenrir",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "You must become paralyzed by now.",
      "translation" : "你現在一定已經麻痺了。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 523,
      "npc" : "Fenrir",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "...But don't expect me to kill you that easily...",
      "translation" : "...不過別以為我會這麼輕易殺了你..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 525,
      "npc" : "Fenrir",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Bijou]",
      "translation" : "[碧珠]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 526,
      "npc" : "Fenrir",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "I should take care of this downright annoying cleric gal first.",
      "translation" : "我得先解決那個煩人的女祭司。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 529,
      "npc" : "Fenrir",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Fenrir]",
      "translation" : "[芬里爾]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 530,
      "npc" : "Fenrir",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "I...Iris!!",
      "translation" : "艾...艾麗絲！！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 533,
      "npc" : "Fenrir",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Sarah]",
      "translation" : "[莎拉]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 534,
      "npc" : "Fenrir",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "......",
      "translation" : "..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 538,
      "npc" : "Fenrir",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Bijou]",
      "translation" : "[碧珠]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 539,
      "npc" : "Fenrir",
      "state" : "translated",
