      "line" : 793,
      "npc" : "Iris",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "No! Stop!!",
      "translation" : "不！住手！！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 797,
      "npc" : "Iris",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Bijou]",
      "translation" : "[碧珠]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 798,
      "npc" : "Iris",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "~Chuckles~",
      "translation" : "~輕笑~"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 799,
      "npc" : "Iris",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "So you're looking for a partner, eh?",
      "translation" : "哦，你是在找同伴啊？"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 800,
      "npc" : "Iris",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Good idea, but...I think it's too late.",
      "translation" : "主意不錯，不過...我想已經太遲了。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 803,
      "npc" : "Iris",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Bijou]",
      "translation" : "[碧珠]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 804,
      "npc" : "Iris",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Because...",
      "translation" : "因為..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 805,
      "npc" : "Iris",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "This will be the final, fatal blow to you. Wahahaha!",
      "translation" : "這將是給你們的最後一擊，也是致命一擊。哇哈哈哈！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 811,
      "npc" : "Iris",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Bijou]",
      "translation" : "[碧珠]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 812,
      "npc" : "Iris",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "....~Sighs~",
      "translation" : "...~嘆氣~"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 813,
      "npc" : "Iris",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Huh?...In my stomach...",
      "translation" : "咦...？我的肚子..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 814,
      "npc" : "Iris",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "This knife...",
      "translation" : "這把刀..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 815,
      "npc" : "Iris",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Sa...Sarah...? How?",
      "translation" : "莎...莎拉...？怎麼會..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 819,
      "npc" : "Iris",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Sarah]",
      "translation" : "[莎拉]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 820,
      "npc" : "Iris",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Is that all you want to say?",
      "translation" : "你就只想說這些嗎？"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 821,
      "npc" : "Iris",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Don't worry. I'll let Himelmez know of your brave contribution. Don't blame me, Bijou.",
      "translation" : "放心吧，我會把你的英勇表現轉告希梅爾茲的。別怪我，碧珠。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 823,
      "npc" : "Iris",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Bijou]",
      "translation" : "[碧珠]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 824,
      "npc" : "Iris",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Why...? Tell me why!",
      "translation" : "為什麼...？告訴我為什麼！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 825,
      "npc" : "Iris",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "...That...that little chick...Was that it? Because she's your sister? Was that it? Tell me, Sarah!",
      "translation" : "...那個...那個小丫頭...是因為她嗎？因為她是你的妹妹？是這樣嗎？告訴我，莎拉！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 827,
      "npc" : "Iris",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Bijou]",
      "translation" : "[碧珠]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 828,
      "npc" : "Iris",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "~Groans~",
      "translation" : "~呻吟~"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 832,
      "npc" : "Iris",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Sarah]",
      "translation" : "[莎拉]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 833,
      "npc" : "Iris",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "......",
      "translation" : "..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 834,
      "npc" : "Iris",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Your soul has been set free, Bijou.",
      "translation" : "碧珠，你的靈魂已經得到解脫。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 837,
      "npc" : "Iris",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Iris]",
      "translation" : "[艾麗絲]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 838,
      "npc" : "Iris",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "(Did she save me...?)",
      "translation" : "(她救了我...？)"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 840,
      "npc" : "Iris",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Iris]",
      "translation" : "[艾麗絲]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 841,
      "npc" : "Iris",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Sarah...",
      "translation" : "莎拉..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 842,
      "npc" : "Iris",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "It's Sarah, right?",
      "translation" : "你叫莎拉，對吧？"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 843,
      "npc" : "Iris",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "People say we parted when we were little...",
      "translation" : "聽說我們小時候就分開了..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 845,
      "npc" : "Iris",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Iris]",
      "translation" : "[艾麗絲]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 846,
      "npc" : "Iris",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "...So what's your plan, huh? Why...why did you save me?!",
      "translation" : "...那你到底有什麼打算？為什麼...為什麼要救我？！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 847,
      "npc" : "Iris",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Don't you ever think this will ever change my belief! I will never, ever forgive you!",
      "translation" : "別以為這樣就能改變我的信念！我絕不會原諒你！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 849,
      "npc" : "Iris",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Iris]",
      "translation" : "[艾麗絲]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 850,
      "npc" : "Iris",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Mom...Dad...Every people in our town. I'm going to revenge!",
      "translation" : "媽媽...爸爸...還有鎮上的所有人，我要替他們報仇！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 853,
      "npc" : "Iris",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Sarah]",
      "translation" : "[莎拉]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 854,
      "npc" : "Iris",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Shut that mouth!",
      "translation" : "閉嘴！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 855,
      "npc" : "Iris",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Don't be a drama queen as if you're the only victim here.",
      "translation" : "別裝得好像只有你是受害者一樣。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 856,
      "npc" : "Iris",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "They just paid the price for what they sinned. The sin that they committed by killing my mother 12 years ago.",
      "translation" : "他們只是為自己的罪付出了代價。他們十二年前殺害我母親，這就是他們犯下的罪。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 858,
      "npc" : "Iris",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Sarah]",
      "translation" : "[莎拉]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 859,
      "npc" : "Iris",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Do you want me to tell you the truth? Those 'loved ones' you're incessantly talking about...Our great elder and the people in our town were actually...",
      "translation" : "想聽真相嗎？你一直掛在嘴邊的那些“親人”...我們的大長老和鎮上的人其實..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 861,
      "npc" : "Iris",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Sarah]",
      "translation" : "[莎拉]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 862,
      "npc" : "Iris",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "......",
      "translation" : "..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 863,
      "npc" : "Iris",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Stop it...",
      "translation" : "別說了..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 864,
      "npc" : "Iris",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Ymir's Heart comes first, no matter what.",
      "translation" : "無論如何，尤彌爾之心最重要。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 866,
      "npc" : "Iris",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Sarah]",
      "translation" : "[莎拉]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 867,
      "npc" : "Iris",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Mark my word.",
      "translation" : "記住我的話。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 868,
      "npc" : "Iris",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "I didn't let you live.",
      "translation" : "我可沒打算放過你。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 869,
      "npc" : "Iris",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "I will let you die soon.",
      "translation" : "我很快就會讓你死。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 870,
      "npc" : "Iris",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "I make sure you no longer see the light of day the next time when we meet.",
      "translation" : "下次見面時，我會讓你再也見不到天日。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 872,
      "npc" : "Iris",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Sarah]",
      "translation" : "[莎拉]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 873,
      "npc" : "Iris",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Don't you ever let anyone kill you until then, Iris.",
      "translation" : "在那之前，艾麗絲，別讓任何人殺了你。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 874,
      "npc" : "Iris",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "I'd better bid farewell for today, then.",
      "translation" : "那麼今天就先告辭了。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 879,
      "npc" : "Iris",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Fenrir]",
      "translation" : "[芬里爾]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 880,
      "npc" : "Iris",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "~Grunts~ That Valkyrie destroyed the ceiling when taking Ymir's Heart!",
      "translation" : "~悶哼~那女武神奪走尤彌爾之心時把天花板毀掉了！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 882,
      "npc" : "Iris",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Fenrir]",
      "translation" : "[芬里爾]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 883,
      "npc" : "Iris",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "We'd better get out of here, too! This place is too dangerous!",
      "translation" : "我們也趕緊離開這裡！這裡太危險了！"
    }
  ]
